      "calculationScope": "EXACT_MANUAL_CALCULATION",
      "manualArithmetic": "Source actual relations are symbolic. Constant electricalP=V*i overduration gives Ein=V*i*duration, and useful fractioneta gives DeltaT=eta*Ein/(mass*c) when phase/capacity changes and other storage are absent. Reviewer6V*2A*2s gives24J; quarter useful gives6J, heating capacity2J/K by3K. Dividing byquarter instead gives96J and exposes an invalid energy gain. Celsius increments andkelvin increments agree; minutes need60 conversion. Liftingmgh is energy and inputminususeful islost/storedoutsideusefulsystem. E(t)=Einitial+P*t has slopeP; a plateau haszero netP, compatible with nonzeroequal5Win/5Wout. The qualitativeSVG has no calibrated numbers and supports these signs, not a numerical heating rate. Variablepower requiresintegration, not the constant shortcut.",
