      "physicalAssumptions": "Positive input electricalpower by chosen energy-arrow convention, constant productV*i overinterval. Usefulfraction0<=eta<=1 without additional unmodelled energy sources. Constant mass/specificheat, no phasechange or materialtemperature dependence inmcDeltaT model. System boundary specifies container/loss/storage; thermal isolation isnot a denial of electrical work input. Energyplateau meansnet balancezero, not absenceoftransfer.",
